# Build context hygiene: source only.
#
# The production image is built from this tree, and the debug compose file
# mounts .env and bot.db from the host instead of baking them in. Keeping both
# out of the build context is what makes that promise true: a secret or a live
# database must never end up in a layer, even a throwaway one.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
bot.db
bot.db-*
bot.log
bot.log.*
bin/
.impeccable/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.log
